: General Ward, Bed: GW-12</td><td style=\\\"border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;\\\"><strong>Doctor:</strong> Dr. R.K.SUNDRIYAL</td></tr></table><div style=\\\"margin-bottom:12px;\\\"><div style=\\\"font-size:11pt;font-weight:bold;color:#0f172a;background:#e2e8f0;padding:4px 8px;border-left:4px solid #0284c7;margin-bottom:6px;\\\">Chief complaints</div><ul><li>Abdominal Pain</li><li>Cough</li><li>Vomiting</li><li>Acute chest pain</li><li>Chest Pain</li></ul></div><div style=\\\"margin-bottom:12px;\\\"><div style=\\\"font-size:11pt;font-weight:bold;color:#0f172a;background:#e2e8f0;padding:4px 8px;border-left:4px solid #0284c7;margin-bottom:6px;\\\">Discharge Diagnosis</div><ul><li>VIRAL DISEASE</li></ul></div><div style=\\\"margin-bottom:12px;\\\"><div style=\\\"font-size:11pt;font-weight:bold;color:#0f172a;background:#e2e8f0;padding:4px 8px;border-left:4px solid #0284c7;margin-bottom:6px;\\\">Procedures</div><ul><li>Laparoscopy of rectum</li></ul></div><div style=\\\"margin-bottom:12px;\\\"><div style=\\\"font-size:11pt;font-weight:bold;color:#0f172a;background:#e2e8f0;padding:4px 8px;border-left:4px solid #0284c7;margin-bottom:6px;\\\">Discharge Medications</div><ul><li>ACILOC - EMPTY STOMACH | BD |    |     (BD)</li><li>PANTOP DSR - EMPTY STOMACH | OD |    |     (OD)</li></ul></div><div style=\\\"margin-bottom:12px;\\\"><div style=\\\"font-size:11pt;font-weight:bold;color:#0f172a;background:#e2e8f0;padding:4px 8px;border-left:4px solid #0284c7;margin-bottom:6px;\\\">General Examination on Admission</div><ul><li>Pulse: 70 /min</li><li>Respiration: 20 /min</li><li>BP: 140/90 mmHg</li><li>SPO2: 95 %</li><li>Temp: 96 degF</li></ul></div><div style=\\\"margin-bottom:12px;\\\"><div style=\\\"font-size:11pt;font-weight:bold;color:#0f172a;background:#e2e8f0;padding:4px 8px;border-left:4px solid #0284c7;margin-bottom:6px;\\\">Follow-Up Instructions</div><ul><li>Dietary Advice: 1. Fruits and Vegetables: पर्याप्त विटामिन और खनिज सुनिश्चित करने के लिए प्रतिदिन विभिन्न प्रका